from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=9,prereqs=[2,5],lead=P("Connect Boolean logic to instructions, registers and memory. Trace an accumulator machine and explore why access patterns affect a cache.","把布尔逻辑连接到指令、寄存器与内存，跟踪累加器机器，探究访问模式如何影响缓存。"),before=P("Know binary and operation counts. The teaching CPU separates its instruction list from data memory and uses explicitly wrapping eight-bit arithmetic.","了解二进制与操作计数。教学 CPU 分离指令列表和数据内存，明确采用八位回绕算术。"),outcomes=[P("Relate gates to arithmetic.","联系逻辑门与算术。"),P("Trace fetch/decode/execute.","跟踪取指、译码与执行。"),P("Separate registers and memory.","区分寄存器与内存。"),P("Explain cache locality and conflicts.","解释缓存局部性与冲突。"),P("Identify simulation assumptions.","识别模拟假设。")],sections=[
S("Boolean gates and adders","逻辑门与加法器","<p>AND, OR and NOT operate on bits; XOR is one when its inputs differ. A half adder computes sum=a XOR b and carry=a AND b. With an incoming carry, a full adder produces a sum bit and an outgoing carry; chaining adders handles multiple bit positions. Combinational circuits depend on current inputs, while sequential circuits retain state, usually updated around clock events. A truth table specifies the function, but actual hardware also has propagation delay and physical constraints.</p>","<p>AND、OR、NOT 操作位，XOR 在输入不同时为一。半加器的和为异或、进位为与。有输入进位的全加器产生和与输出进位，链接后处理多位。组合电路依赖当前输入，时序电路保存状态，通常按时钟更新。真值表规定功能，实际硬件还有传播延迟与物理约束。</p>","For a=b=1, what are half-adder sum and carry?","a=b=1 时半加器和与进位？","Sum 0, carry 1: binary 10.","和零、进位一，即二进制 10。"),
S("Instructions and architectural state","指令与体系结构状态","<p>An instruction set defines machine-visible operations. Registers hold small working values; the program counter identifies the next instruction. Our model has an accumulator, a program counter, eight data slots and SET, ADD, STORE, HALT instructions. The logical cycle fetches an instruction, decodes its operation and updates state. Real processors may overlap work through pipelines, but observable results must respect their architecture's rules. The model is intentionally simpler and does not simulate pipelines or machine-code encoding.</p>","<p>指令集规定机器可见操作。寄存器保存工作值，程序计数器指向下一指令。模型有累加器、计数器、八个数据槽和 SET、ADD、STORE、HALT。逻辑周期取指、译码、更新状态。真实处理器可通过流水线重叠工作，但可观察结果需遵守体系结构规则。本模型不模拟流水线或机器编码。</p>","Which state identifies the next instruction?","哪个状态标识下一指令？","The program counter.","程序计数器。"),
S("Memory, addresses and representation","内存、地址与表示","<p>Memory associates addresses with stored values. Loading reads a value; storing writes one. An address is not the same as the value at that address. In the lab, STORE 0 writes the accumulator into data slot zero; it does not set the accumulator to zero. Real byte-addressed machines need agreements on width, alignment and byte order when reading multibyte values. The model uses Python list slots rather than real byte-addressed RAM, so its eight slots must not be mistaken for an entire physical memory system.</p>","<p>内存关联地址与保存值，加载读取，存储写入。地址不同于该地址的值。STORE 0 把累加器写入零号槽，不是把累加器设零。真实按字节寻址机器读取多字节值需规定宽度、对齐与字节序。模型使用 Python 列表槽，八槽不等同完整物理内存系统。</p>","After acc=7 and STORE 2, what changes?","累加器七后 STORE 2，改变什么？","Memory slot 2 becomes 7; the accumulator remains 7.","槽二变七，累加器仍七。"),
S("Caches and locality","缓存与局部性","<p>Memory hierarchies trade capacity against access latency. A cache keeps recently accessed blocks. Temporal locality reuses the same data; spatial locality accesses nearby data. Our direct-mapped cache chooses line=address mod lines and tag=address divided by lines. A matching valid tag gives a hit; otherwise a new tag replaces it. Addresses 0 and 4 conflict in a four-line cache despite repeated reuse. Real caches use multi-byte blocks, associativity and write policies; the one-word read model isolates mapping conflicts.</p>","<p>存储层次权衡容量与延迟。缓存保存近期块，时间局部性复用数据，空间局部性访问邻近数据。直接映射模型用地址取模选行、整除得标记，相同有效标记命中，否则替换。四行中地址零和四冲突。真实缓存还有多字节块、关联度与写策略，单字读取模型只突出映射冲突。</p>","Can repeated access still miss because of conflicts?","反复访问仍可能因冲突未命中吗？","Yes: alternating 0 and 4 evicts each other in the model.","可以，零与四交替互相替换。"),
S("Performance and abstraction boundaries","性能与抽象边界","<p>Execution time depends on instruction count, average work per instruction and clock period, but these factors interact. A higher clock rate alone does not guarantee a faster whole program. Branches, memory stalls and data dependencies affect throughput. Optimising a tiny fraction of runtime also limits total speedup: if 90% remains unchanged, even infinitely accelerating the other 10% gives at most 1/0.9≈1.11 times overall speed. Profile before choosing a hardware or algorithm optimisation, and keep the model's assumptions explicit.</p>","<p>耗时依赖指令数、每指令平均工作与时钟周期，因素相互影响，频率更高不保证整体更快。分支、内存等待与依赖影响吞吐。若九成运行不变，即使其余一成无限加速，总加速最多 1/0.9≈1.11。优化前先分析瓶颈，明确模型假设。</p>","Can improving only 10% of runtime yield a 10× total speedup?","仅优化一成能整体十倍吗？","No; the unchanged 90% bounds speedup to about 1.11×.","不能，剩余九成把加速限制约 1.11 倍。")],
labs=[dict(file="m09_cpu.py",title=P("Trace a tiny CPU","跟踪微型 CPU"),intro=P("Predict each accumulator value and program counter. This model increments the counter before executing the operation.","预测累加器与计数器，模型在执行操作前递增计数器。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Compute 3+4 into slot 1.</li><li>Try STORE 9 and an unknown instruction.</li><li>Remove HALT and explain the boundary error.</li></ol>","<ol><li>把三加四写入槽一。</li><li>尝试 STORE 9 和未知指令。</li><li>删除 HALT，解释边界错误。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Use SET 3, ADD 4, STORE 1, HALT. Invalid addresses and opcodes raise ValueError. Without HALT, the counter leaves the instruction list; the model rejects this instead of silently reading unrelated data.</p>","<p>使用 SET 3、ADD 4、STORE 1、HALT。无效地址或操作抛 ValueError。无 HALT 时计数器超出指令列表，模型明确拒绝。</p>")),dict(file="m09_cache.py",title=P("Cache access patterns","缓存访问模式"),intro=P("Count hits independently of elapsed time. Initially every tag is invalid (None).", "独立于耗时统计命中，初始标记 None 表示无效。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Try eight lines for [0,4,0,4].</li><li>Predict [0,1,2,3,0,1,2,3].</li><li>Explain what a larger block would change.</li></ol>","<ol><li>八行运行零四交替。</li><li>预测零至三重复访问。</li><li>解释更大块会改变什么。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Eight lines separate 0 and 4, giving two hits. Reusing 0–3 with four lines gives four hits after four compulsory misses. A larger block adds spatial reuse but changes index/tag calculations and may create new conflicts.</p>","<p>八行分离零和四，得到两命中。四行重复零至三在四次初次未命中后四命中。更大块增加空间复用，也改变索引标记计算与冲突。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Adder","加法器","Add binary 1+1.","二进制一加一。","<p>10: sum bit zero and carry one.</p>","<p>10，和零进位一。</p>"),E(1,"Wrap","回绕","Compute eight-bit unsigned 250+10 with wrapping.","八位回绕的 250+10？","<p>260 mod 256=4.</p>","<p>260 对 256 取余为四。</p>"),E(2,"Trace","轨迹","Trace SET 2, ADD 3, STORE 0, HALT.","跟踪 SET 2、ADD 3、STORE 0、HALT。","<p>Accumulator states 2 then 5; memory[0]=5; HALT returns memory.</p>","<p>累加器二、五，零槽为五，HALT 返回内存。</p>"),E(2,"Cache tag","缓存标记","Map address 9 with four one-word lines.","地址九映射到四行缓存哪里？","<p>Line 9 mod 4=1, tag 9//4=2.</p>","<p>行一，标记二。</p>"),E(2,"Locality","局部性","Distinguish temporal and spatial locality.","区分时间与空间局部性。","<p>Repeatedly reading one book record is temporal; scanning adjacent records is spatial.</p>","<p>重复读同记录是时间，连续扫描邻接记录是空间。</p>"),E(3,"Speedup","加速","Half a program is accelerated 4×; compute overall speedup.","一半程序四倍加速，整体加速？","<p>New relative time 0.5+0.5/4=0.625; speedup 1.6×.</p>","<p>新相对时间 0.625，加速 1.6 倍。</p>"),E(3,"Model boundary","模型边界","Which real CPU behaviours are absent from the simulator?","模拟器缺少哪些真实 CPU 行为？","<p>Instruction encoding, pipelining, interrupts, virtual memory, variable latency and cache coherence are absent. Its trace demonstrates logical state changes only.</p>","<p>缺少指令编码、流水线、中断、虚拟内存、可变延迟与缓存一致性，只展示逻辑状态变化。</p>"),E(2,"Address and value","地址与值","Why is STORE 0 different from SET 0?","STORE 0 与 SET 0 有何不同？","<p>STORE selects an address and writes the current value; SET selects a new accumulator value.</p>","<p>STORE 选地址并写当前值，SET 设置累加器值。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("XOR of 1 and 1?","一与一异或？","0","0","1","1","2","2","Equal bits give zero.","相同位给零。"),Q("Next instruction location?","下一指令位置？","Program counter","程序计数器","Cache capacity","缓存容量","String encoding","文字编码","The counter records control position.","计数器记录控制位置。"),Q("STORE changes?","STORE 改变什么？","Data memory","数据内存","Only the clock","仅时钟","Source code text","源代码文字","It writes a value at an address.","向地址写值。"),Q("Temporal locality?","时间局部性？","Reuse of recently accessed data","复用近期数据","Only adjacent addresses","仅邻接地址","Sorted titles","有序书名","Spatial locality concerns neighbours.","空间局部性关注邻近。"),Q("0 and 4 in four direct-mapped lines?","四行中零和四怎样？","Same line, different tags","同行不同标记","Different lines always","总不同行","Same value","同值","The index is address mod four.","索引为地址模四。"),Q("Higher clock rate alone guarantees speed?","更高频率单独保证快吗？","No","不保证","Always","总保证","Only for text","仅文字","Work and stalls also matter.","工作量与等待也重要。")],pitfalls=[P("The simulator is a teaching model, not a real ISA implementation.","模拟器是教学模型，不是真实指令集实现。"),P("Cache hit counts do not by themselves determine runtime.","缓存命中次数本身不能确定运行时间。")],reading=[(P("Nand2Tetris project sequence","Nand2Tetris 项目路线"),"https://www.nand2tetris.org/course",P("Inspect the hardware projects from gates to CPU; identify the abstraction at each stage.","查看逻辑门至 CPU 项目，指出各阶段抽象。"))],terms=[(P("Register","寄存器"),P("Small architecturally visible working storage.","小型体系结构可见工作存储。")),(P("Cache miss","缓存未命中"),P("Requested data is not present in the relevant cache entry.","请求数据不在对应缓存项。")),(P("ISA","指令集体系结构"),P("The machine-visible instruction and state contract.","机器可见指令与状态约定。"))],review=P("<p>Trace four instructions and explain a conflict miss. Module 10 shows how the operating system multiplexes and protects the underlying resources.</p>","<p>跟踪四指令并解释冲突未命中。模块 10 将介绍操作系统如何共享并保护资源。</p>")))
